Description: Add-ons for Window Maker: notifications, file browser, menus
 Notification daemon, file browser and menu tools for Window Maker, themed
 from your Window Maker theme. Only one notification daemon can own
 org.freedesktop.Notifications, so stop dunst/mako first.
 .
 Run wm-autostart install to start wmmenud and wmnotify with Window Maker.
